==== hyperbricks yaml {!{plugin}} ====
plugin:
  - type: plugin
  - plugin: example
==== explainer ====
Name of the plugin to render
==== expected json ====
{
  "Classes": null,
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "Data": null,
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "PluginName": "example"
}

==== expected output ====
Plugin example
